[["heading","SOFTWARE ENGINEERING INTERNSHIP / SECTION 04"],["heading","Algorithms and Problem Solving"],["text","Full teaching edition • English + Sinhala • Java"],["text","15 original topics + 7 previously added topics + 5 further additions = 27 lessons."],["heading","HOW TO USE THIS LESSON"],["text","Read the definition, understand the Sinhala explanation, trace the worked example, then\nanswer the interview question and solve the practice task without looking at the answer\nkey."],["sinhala","","මුලින් concept එක Jතේරුම් ගන්න. ඊළඟට example එක step by step trace කරන්න. Interview answer එක simple English වලින් කියන්න practice කරන්න.",437],["heading","CONTENTS"],["text","01. Big O, Omega and Theta"],["text","15. Edge cases and dry runs"],["text","02. Time and space complexity"],["text","16. Prefix sums"],["text","03. Best, average and worst cases"],["text","17. Divide and conquer"],["text","04. Linear and binary search"],["text","18. Stable vs unstable sort"],["text","05. Bubble, selection and insertion sort"],["text","19. Memoization vs tabulation"],["text","06. Merge sort and quicksort"],["text","20. Topological sort"],["text","07. Recursion and base cases"],["text","21. Dijkstra and shortest paths"],["text","08. Two pointers"],["text","22. Bit manipulation"],["text","09. Sliding window"],["text","23. Binary search boundaries"],["text","10. Frequency counting"],["text","24. Heap sort and counting sort"],["text","11. BFS and DFS"],["text","25. Cycle detection"],["text","12. Greedy basics"],["text","26. Monotonic stack"],["text","13. Dynamic programming basics"],["text","27. Amortized complexity"],["text","14. Backtracking basics"],["text","Scope: original checklist section 04 and compact guide additions, plus five further interview topics.\nSnippets are illustrative Java fragments: place statements in main and methods/classes in an appropriate\nclass; inputs are shown in the output or example. Not a complete application."]]